literal_statement:
\begin{enumerate}
\item[(a)] Find $0/1$-polytopes with non-unimodal, non-log-concave, etc. $h^*$-vectors. 
\item[(b)] Find $0/1$-polytopes with non-unimodal, non-log-concave, etc. $f$-vectors. 
\item[(c)] Find $0/\pm1$-polytopes with non-unimodal, non-log-concave, etc. $h^*$-vectors. 
\end{enumerate}
